      "refersTo": "audit-record",
      "description": "Full monospace values on the strong blue field; sample content is synthetic.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-record\"><div class=\"ds-record-grid\"><span class=\"ds-record-label\">Draw ID</span><span>synthetic-draw-00000001</span><span class=\"ds-record-label\">Published seed</span><span>synthetic-seed</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-record{padding:1.5rem;border-radius:var(--cibc-radius-control);background:var(--cibc-color-surface-strong);color:var(--cibc-color-on-surface-strong);font-family:var(--cibc-font-mono);font-size:var(--cibc-text-ui);line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all}.ds-record-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,11rem) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem 1.5rem}.ds-record-label{font-family:var(--cibc-font-sans);font-size:var(--cibc-text-caption);font-weight:600}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-record-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:.5rem}.ds-record-grid>:nth-child(even){margin-bottom:.75rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Information disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "disclosure-info",
      "description": "Native explanation disclosure with a generous summary target.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-disclosure\" open><summary>Is this draw fair? How to verify it<svg class=\"ds-chevron\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"ds-disclosure-body\">Every Allotment draw is reproducible.</div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-disclosure{border:1px solid var(--cibc-color-info-border);border-radius:var(--cibc-radius-control);background:var(--cibc-color-info-surface);font-family:var(--cibc-font-sans);font-size:var(--cibc-text-ui);line-height:var(--cibc-leading-ui);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-disclosure summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;min-height:var(--cibc-control-height);padding:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cibc-color-info);cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.ds-disclosure summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-disclosure summary:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em}.ds-disclosure summary:focus-visible{outline:var(--cibc-focus-width) solid var(--cibc-color-focus);outline-offset:var(--cibc-focus-offset)}.ds-chevron{flex-shrink:0;margin-left:auto;transition:transform var(--cibc-duration-fast)}.ds-disclosure[open] .ds-chevron{transform:rotate(180deg)}.ds-disclosure-body{padding:0 1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--cibc-color-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-disclosure summary{min-height:var(--cibc-control-touch)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-chevron{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Probability distribution",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "probability-distribution",
      "description": "All ten ranges and counts survive reflow; synthetic counts illustrate the pattern.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-distribution\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Selection probability distribution\"><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:0\"><span class=\"ds-range\">0–10%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">0<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:0\"><span class=\"ds-range\">10–20%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">0<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:0\"><span class=\"ds-range\">20–30%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">0<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:.25\"><span class=\"ds-range\">30–40%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">1<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:.5\"><span class=\"ds-range\">40–50%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">2<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:1\"><span class=\"ds-range\">50–60%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">4<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:.5\"><span class=\"ds-range\">60–70%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">2<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:.25\"><span class=\"ds-range\">70–80%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">1<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:0\"><span class=\"ds-range\">80–90%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">0<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-bucket\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"--ds-bucket-scale:0\"><span class=\"ds-range\">90–100%</span><div class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-fill\"></div></div><span class=\"ds-count\">0<span class=\"ds-sr-only\"> candidates</span></span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-distribution{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.5rem;font-family:var(--cibc-font-sans);font-size:var(--cibc-text-caption);line-height:var(--cibc-leading-ui);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--cibc-color-text-secondary);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-bucket{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 5rem auto;gap:.5rem;text-align:center;min-width:0}.ds-range{grid-row:3}.ds-count{grid-row:1}.ds-track{grid-row:2;background:var(--cibc-data-empty);position:relative}.ds-fill{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--cibc-data-high);transform:scaleY(var(--ds-bucket-scale));transform-origin:bottom}.ds-sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-distribution{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:.75rem}.ds-bucket{grid-template-columns:6rem minmax(0,1fr) 2rem;grid-template-rows:auto;align-items:center;text-align:left}.ds-range,.ds-track,.ds-count{grid-row:auto}.ds-track{height:1rem}.ds-fill{transform:scaleX(var(--ds-bucket-scale));transform-origin:left}}@media(max-width:360px){.ds-bucket{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 2rem}.ds-range{grid-column:1/-1}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Open Index",
    "overview": "Allotment makes civic selection approachable through generous type, plain-language explanations and clearly labelled states. Yellow surrounds a white working surface; blue marks action, the current stage and the reproducibility record. Warmth comes from the page field and readable pacing rather than muted text or decorative effects.\n\nThis records the completed, user-approved adoption of Open Index (0.2.0-draft.1), pinned to immutable foundation revision `6df5682711d11d1dde20453d0e06a78aca48b34f`. The canonical foundation is `cibc-design-system/tokens.css`; its `guides/adoption.md` defines adoption boundaries. Allotment consumes the pinned dependency's `fonts.css` and `tokens.css` through `ui/src/main.tsx`, then maps its plain-CSS roles in `ui/src/index.css`. This is a light-only application: the foundation's dark palette is not an adopted theme, and there is no new theme preference storage.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Large locally served Public Sans, with monospace reserved for reproducibility values.",
      "Flat yellow, white and blue fields; semantic feedback remains distinct.",
      "Explicit sequence and state labels, not colour-only signals.",
      "Responsive reflow preserves the complete task and its evidence."
    ],
    "rules": [
      { "name": "The Brand Is Not Status Rule", "body": "Blue carries action and reference fields; green, amber and red carry outcome meaning, with visible text or icons alongside colour.", "section": "colors" },
      { "name": "The Readable Detail Rule", "body": "Captions, table text, repeated quota labels and audit values retain the UI-size floor; hierarchy must not depend on microtype.", "section": "typography" }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use the immutable foundation dependency and local font imports before the application adapter.",
      "**Do** keep every progress state, quota field and distribution bucket explicitly labelled through reflow.",
      "**Do** preserve full seed/hash values and allow control labels and containers to grow with enlarged text.",
      "**Do** pair feedback colour with text or icons and preserve keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** reuse success green as the brand action colour or infer a success state from a blue field.",
      "**Don't** restore small uppercase micro-labels, pulse the current step or introduce decorative shadows.",
      "**Don't** silently enable the foundation's dark theme or add theme preference storage.",
      "**Don't** treat the sidecar's synthesized tonal previews as new application colours or rewrite the pinned foundation locally."
    ]
  }
}
